Source: hwprivacy
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: perieteanu <perieteanu@debian.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               cargo,
               rustc,
               libgtk-4-dev,
               libdbus-1-dev,
               pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/perieteanu/hwprivacy

Package: hwprivacy-daemon
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         pipewire,
         wireplumber
Description: Hardware privacy daemon
 Background service that manages hardware privacy controls such as
 camera, microphone, and other device toggles via D-Bus.

Package: hwprivacy-ctl
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         hwprivacy-daemon
Description: Hardware privacy command-line tool
 Command-line interface for controlling hardware privacy settings
 through the hwprivacy daemon.

Package: hwprivacy-tui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         hwprivacy-daemon
Description: Hardware privacy terminal UI
 Terminal user interface for controlling hardware privacy settings
 through the hwprivacy daemon.

Package: hwprivacy-gui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         hwprivacy-daemon,
         libgtk-4-1
Description: Hardware privacy graphical UI
 GTK 4 graphical user interface for controlling hardware privacy
 settings through the hwprivacy daemon.
